    "prompt": "Implement the following change to the application so that it fully satisfies\nthe specification and all existing and new tests pass. Run the test suite and\nmake it green before finishing.\n\nStore telephone numbers as digits only (strip spaces, dashes and parentheses); return the stored value in the 'telephone' field, and apply this normalization before the telephone-uniqueness check so '(613) 555-0100' and '6135550100' are treated as the same number.\n"
